      "short": "Painted view of a hillside village overlooking a bay, with smoke rising from chimneys and mountains in the distance.",
      "long": "A painted scene depicting a settlement on a sloping terrain in the foreground, featuring houses with terracotta-colored roofs, light beige walls, and multiple dark chimneys—some emitting plumes of white smoke. Green patches suggest vegetation among the buildings. Beyond the settlement lies a broad expanse of deep blue water, with a thin pier or breakwater extending from the left shore. In the background, undulating hills or mountains recede in layers of cool gray and violet tones, partially obscured by atmospheric haze. The sky above is rendered in soft, blended strokes of pale blue, white, and gray.",
